{
  "description": "<div data-editor-id=\"97c491cc-095a-4d68-8e44-756d34f8f204\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: inherit\" data-color-scope=\"outer\"><span>This final video reviews the key lessons from the course and reinforces that effective engagement depends on clear goals, thoughtful design, human judgment, and a commitment to act on what communities contribute. It introduces additional resources, including an AI-powered coaching tool, to help learners design their own engagement projects.</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem\"><span style=\"color: rgb(222, 222, 222); text-decoration: inherit\" data-color-scope=\"inner\">Last Updated: July 24, 2026</span></span></p></div>",
  "lessons": [
